Package: PanelKmeansInference
Type: Package
Title: Panel Kmeans with Selective Inference
Version: 0.2.4
Authors@R: person("Oguzhan", "Akgun", email = "Oguzhan.Akgun@u-bourgogne.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Panel Kmeans clustering with multiple initializations and selection of the number
    of clusters by an information criterion; selective inference on estimated cluster means with
    the decomposition in the metric of the long-run covariance matrix, conditioning on the
    selected partition and on the choice of the number of clusters.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Suggests:
    Rcpp
Imports:
    intervals,
    parallel,
    stats
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
